Feather Fall									KEY:Feather Fall ~ Constant								CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.SpellLike							DEFINE:SLA_CL|0	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=ATWILL|CASTERLEVEL=SLA_CL|Feather Fall																				DESC:You can feather fall, as per the spell, as a constant ability.|!PRERULE:1,DisplayFullAbility	DESC:You can feather fall, as per the spell, as a constant ability. Constant spell-like abilities function at all times but can be dispelled. Constant spell-like abilities can be reactivated a as a swift action.|PRERULE:1,DisplayFullAbility


